  "domain": "tier0/ao-mixed/operator",
  "description": "Decision 131 composition-path control, Legacy, AO L32F, 256 px, grid2x2. The same grey-a AO mesh map supplies code x/255 to all sets. s0/s2 use grey-b at opacity 0.5; s1/s3 use the authored EXR32F ao-precomposed-half at opacity 1. Its RGB rows are fma(float32(float32(y/255)-1),0.5,1), with no oracle pixels. s0/s1 use Nearest; s2/s3 use BilinearHQ. Identity UV, RepeatNone, Normal blend. The authored precomposed values survive the opacity-1 blend exactly at every row. Compare matched pairs only after verifying bit-identical channel and mesh EXR exports. A virtual operator determined solely by those exported operands predicts identical AO_Mixed in each pair. A difference rejects that hypothesis; agreement alone does not establish an arithmetic rule. AO_Mixed, channel and mesh exported twice as PNG8 and twice as EXR32F, passthrough, no dithering; repeat all exports after Full save/close/reopen. No opacity-0.75 case.",
